--- !u!114 &6261755356071999586
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3032764378146422893}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 25f4056da21fa2b4d9f55fd0b1e45bb6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  loadingBarDatas:
  - _Titel: <color=green>Level 1 Begins</color>
    _Description: Sirihanna has located an angry mob of your haters downtown, following
      your latest drop. You need to head down there and clear them out by washing
      them off the streets. Sirihanna will have your equipment when you get there.
  - _Titel: <color=green>Level 2 Begins</color>
    _Description: 'Just before getting completely washed, the final hater henchman
      radios back to headquarters to warn the big boss that you''re loaded with their
      worst enemy: soapy water...'
  - _Titel: <color=green>Level 3 Begins</color>
    _Description: Even though you made light work of their low-level shooter, the
      hate runs deep for the big boss. Now they've pulled out the big OGs to get
      you outta here. Will you survive?
  titelText: {fileID: 2093227810241462918}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 6401032183630677991}
  infiniteModeDescription: The big boss can't get you with local haters only, so
    out-of-towners have been recruited to wear you down before they can finally take
    you out. How long can you survive?
